  "body": "Welcome to 22 Ara Taha Crescent, Orewa – a stunning, high-specification family home now completed and presented to the market. Masterfully built with uncompromising attention to detail, this newly finished residence offers an intelligent, flexible layout perfectly tailored for modern, upscale family living.\r\n\r\nDesigned to maximize natural light and capture beautiful outlooks, the heart of the home sits elevated on the upper level, offering the ultimate lifestyle for families and entertainers alike.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights\r\n• Property Layout: 4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms | 2-Car Garage + Extra Parking\r\n• Climate Control: Fully Ducted Central Air Conditioning System for year-round comfort\r\n• Guarantee: 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee for absolute peace of mind\r\n• Premium Finishes: Quality curtains already installed throughout. Fisher & Paykel kitchen appliances \r\n• Craftsmanship: Warm, solid timber flooring throughout main areas\r\n• Entertainment & special features: background speakers system, LED lighting features \r\n• Comfort living style: underfloor heating in all bathrooms, great indoor-and outdoor flow with large backyard deck\r\n\r\nProperty Features & Layout\r\n• Upper Level (Entertainment Hub):\r\n- Expansive open-plan living and dining space centered around a gourmet executive kitchen.\r\n- Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a generous outdoor deck and beautifully landscaped garden – ideal for alfresco dining and summer BBQs.\r\n- 2 spacious bedrooms, including a luxurious Master Suite complete with a private ensuite.\r\n\r\n • Ground Level (Flexible Living):\r\n- 2 additional double bedrooms and a stylish full bathroom – perfect for teenagers, guests, or a quiet work-from-home setup.\r\n- Spacious internal-access double garage with a dedicated vehicle access and parking bay. \r\n\r\nPrime Orewa Location:\r\n•  Minutes from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, bustling cafes, and top-tier local schools.\r\n•  Quick and easy access to the motorway for an effortless commute.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or to receive full details on the property.",
